  {
   "default": "0",
   "description": "Grace period, in minutes from when a ticket reaches this unit, during which a cancelled order is simply DELETED — the card vanishes and no cook is interrupted. After it expires the food may already be on, so a captain can only REQUEST cancellation with a reason, and this unit has to Accept before the order is removed. Leave 0 (or blank) to inherit the POS Profile's default. Tune it per unit: a bar can usually un-pour a drink for longer than a kitchen can un-cook a steak.",
